  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*so we can compute the good weights for rectangular reps in a much simpler way without needing to build the huge Cartan matrices*)\nClearAll[FindWeight2, FindGoodWeight2];\nFindGoodWeight2[rep1_,rep2_]:=Permutations[rep1+rep2];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*checking that it gives the same result as above*)\nFindGoodWeight2[{3,3,0,0},{5,5,0,0}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"421327\" data-output-id=\"80\" data-out-n=\"125\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[125]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mrynj9im-aa2p7vm\" data-page-width-em=\"58\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9OCAmIDggJiAwICYgMFxcOCAmIDAgJiA4ICYgMFxcOCAmIDAgJiAwICYgOFxcMCAmIDggJiA4ICYgMFxcMCAmIDggJiAwICYgOFxcMCAmIDAgJiA4ICYgOFxlbmR7cG1hdHJpeH0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.2001em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.8499em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:9.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:7.200em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"7.200em\" viewBox=\"0 0 875 7200\"><path d=\"M863,9c0,-2,-2,-5,-6,-9c0,0,-17,0,-17,0c-12.7,0,-19.3,0.3,-20,1\nc-5.3,5.3,-10.3,11,-15,17c-242.7,294.7,-395.3,682,-458,1162c-21.3,163.3,-33.3,349,\n-36,557 l0,3684c0.2,6,0,26,0,60c2,159.3,10,310.7,24,454c53.3,528,210,\n949.7,470,1265c4.7,6,9.7,11.7,15,17c0.7,0.7,7,1,19,1c0,0,18,0,18,0c4,-4,6,-7,6,-9\nc0,-2.7,-3.3,-8.7,-10,-18c-135.3,-192.7,-235.5,-414.3,-300.5,-665c-65,-250.7,-102.5,\n-544.7,-112.5,-882c-2,-104,-3,-167,-3,-189\nl0,-3692c0,-162.7,5.7,-314,17,-454c20.7,-272,63.7,-513,129,-723c65.3,\n-210,15